# `A as B := body` (decision general-conversions) converts every `x as B` of an A, its value `it`
'class A { v: int }; class B { v: int }; A as B := B(it.v * 2); a = A(3); (a as B).v'	6
'class P { name: text }; P as text := it.name; p = P("ada"); p as text'	"ada"
'class P { name: text }; P as text := "P " + it.name; str(P("ada"))'	"P ada"
'use units; Length as text := "L"; str(3m)'	"L"
